{"ref":"character:lisa-tepes","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Lisa Tepes is an initially hidden playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. Her starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Luminatio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:luminatio"}," ",{"t":"Luminatio","r":"weapon:luminatio"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Upon unlocking the ",{"i":"Sprite-Belnades'_Spellbook.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"}," ",{"t":"Belnades' Spellbook","r":"weapon:belnades-spellbook"},", Lisa is able to start with it as an alternate starting weapon via ",{"i":"Sprite-Mindbender.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:mindbender"}," ",{"t":"skin selection","r":"relic:mindbender"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Lisa"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_LISA"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Lisa_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Luminatio.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:luminatio"}," ",{"t":"Luminatio","r":"weapon:luminatio"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Evolve the ",{"t":"Wine Glass","r":"weapon:wine-glass"},"."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 2,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[[{"i":"Music-Ode_to_Castlevania-Keygen_Church.png","w":20,"h":20}," \"Wandering The Crystal Blue - Vampire Survivors\""]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+20%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+5"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+5"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+5"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Lisa Tepes can be unlocked by evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Wine_Glass.png","w":15,"h":24,"r":"weapon:wine-glass"}," ",{"t":"Wine Glass","r":"weapon:wine-glass"},". Lisa Tepes is then made available for purchas for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 2,000, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Lisa Tepes can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"mourned\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Lisa starts with +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," and +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Rerolls","r":"powerup:reroll"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banishes","r":"powerup:banish"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skips","r":"powerup:skip"},". She also gains +1% ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"}," every level. There is no cap on this bonus."]},{"k":"p","c":["She also starts with an extra ",{"i":"Sprite-Silent_Old_Sanctuary_(XX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:silent-old-sanctuary-xx"}," ",{"t":"Silent Old Sanctuary (XX)","r":"arcana:silent-old-sanctuary-xx"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Lisa can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Even though she starts with Silent Old Sanctuary, which encourages limited-slot builds, it is not recommended to lower her weapon slots below 2 as she cannot build ",{"i":"Sprite-Universitas.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:universitas"}," ",{"t":"Universitas","r":"weapon:universitas"}," without both ",{"i":"Sprite-Vol_Luminatio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vol-luminatio"}," ",{"t":"Vol Luminatio","r":"weapon:vol-luminatio"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Vol_Umbra.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vol-umbra"}," ",{"t":"Vol Umbra","r":"weapon:vol-umbra"},", although the latter can eventually be obtained from a ",{"i":"Sprite-Candybox.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:candybox"}," ",{"t":"Candybox","r":"weapon:candybox"},"/",{"i":"Sprite-Super_Candybox_II_Turbo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:super-candybox-ii-turbo"}," ",{"t":"Super Candybox II Turbo","r":"weapon:super-candybox-ii-turbo"},"."]},{"c":["An optimized build involves limiting weapon slots to 2 and, instead of ",{"i":"Sprite-Umbra.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:umbra"}," ",{"t":"Umbra","r":"weapon:umbra"},", acquiring ",{"i":"Sprite-Lifesign_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," ",{"t":"Lifesign Scan","r":"weapon:lifesign-scan"}," to evolve into ",{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"},". Even with an extra weapon slot filled, the massive cooldown reduction from Silent Old Sanctuary combined with an ",{"i":"Sprite-Empty_Tome.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:empty-tome"}," ",{"t":"Empty Tome","r":"passive:empty-tome"}," will rapidly snowball Paranormal Scan to absurd levels, making Vol Umbra and Universitas mostly unnecessary, though they can still eventually be obtained through the Candybox."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Lisa_Tepes.png","w":81,"h":120,"c":["Lisa Tepes's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Lisa_Tepes.gif","w":81,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Technically, Vampire Survivors marks Lisa's first true appearance in a video game, as her presence in Symphony of the Night was merely an illusion crafted by the ",{"t":"Succubus","r":"character:succubus"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Lisa","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Lisa"}," in the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}